17
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,300
どうもホロライブ二期生、悪魔の保健医、癒月ちょこです
Hello! I'm Yuzuki Choco, Hololive's 2nd generation demon health representative!

18
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,300
お前何しおっちゃ！
What are you doing?!

19
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:51,000
うわー！
Whoa!

20
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:53,500
Thank you so much, thank you very much!

21
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:57,200
ほら、豚、登って、頑張って、豚
Look, pig, climb! Keep going, pig!

22
00:00:57,200 --> 00:01:01,500
ほら、豚、こっちよこっち、どっち？
Look, pig, this way, this way. Which one?

23
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,500
はいはいはいはい
Yes, yes, yes, yes.

24
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:06,000
なんだろう
