急に君が来るなんて
You suddenly coming like that...

53
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:08,000
ね、どこか悪いの？
Hey, is something wrong?

54
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:12,000
何かを期待しているのかな？
Are you expecting something, I wonder?

55
00:03:12,500 --> 00:03:17,500
揺れる心 巡る感情 口づけ 甘い 処方箋
Swaying heart, revolving emotions, a kiss, sweet prescription...

56
00:03:17,500 --> 00:03:22,500
癒されたい 甘えていたい 構ってよ チョコせんせーしょん
Want to be healed, want to be spoiled, pay attention to me, Choco Sensation!

57
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:27,500
君の視線 君の体温 分かっても恋は測れない
Your gaze, your body temperature, even knowing them, love cannot be measured.

58
