癒されたい？ 甘えていたい？ 大・大・大のちょこせんせーしょん
Want to be healed? Want to be pampered? The big, big, big Choco Sensation!

75
00:05:37,408 --> 00:05:41,908
君の視線 君の体温 わかっても恋は測れない
Your gaze, your warmth... Even if I understand them, love cannot be measured.

76
00:05:42,108 --> 00:05:46,608
元気なのに溜め息しちゃう もしかしてもう手遅れ？
Even though I'm fine, I'm sighing. Is it perhaps already too late?

77
00:05:46,708 --> 00:05:52,608
でもどっちつかずじゃ動けないから ときめき運んできてね My Sugar
But I can't move if we are in limbo, so bring me some excitement, my sugar.

78
00:05:53,408 --> 00:05:55,808
ちょこちょこ せんせーしょん Yeah!
Choco Choco Sensation, yeah!

79
00:05:55,808 --> 00:05:58,008
ちょこちょこ せんせーしょん Yeah!
Choco Choco Sensation, yeah!

80
00:05:58,008 --> 00:06:00,408
ちょこちょこ せんせーしょん Yeah!
Choco Choco Sensation, yeah!

81
00:06:00,408 --> 00:06:02,708
ちょこちょこ せんせーしょん Yeah!
Choco Choco Sensation, yeah!

82
