ラムで潰して お願い
Knock me out with rum, please

273
00:18:49,208 --> 00:18:52,708
お砂糖増し増しで
With extra, extra sugar

274
00:18:52,708 --> 00:18:56,208
飲みやすさとかいらない
I don't need it to be easy to drink

275
00:18:56,208 --> 00:18:59,708
灼熱でさ 溶かして
Melt it in the scorching heat

276
00:18:59,708 --> 00:19:03,408
ゴクって飲んで
Take a big gulp

277
00:19:03,408 --> 00:19:08,408
クセのある私のことを
Take care of me

278
00:19:08,408 --> 00:19:11,408
大事にしてよね
even with all my quirks, okay?

279
00:19:11,408 --> 00:19:14,108
サマーチョコレート
Summer chocolate

280
00:19:14,108 --> 00:19:17,308
そろそろ そばに darling baby
It's about time, come close to me, darling baby

281
00:19:17,308 --> 00:19:20,308
とろけちゃって catch me darling
Melt away and catch me, darling

282
00:19:20,308 --> 00:19:22,708
ピュア ピュア ココア ふんわり
Pure, pure cocoa, so fluffy

283
00:19:22,708 --> 00:19:24,108
チュル チュル
Slurp, slurp

284
00:19:24,108 --> 00:19:26,108
ワン・ツー！
One, two!

285
00:19:26,108 --> 00:19:30,908
ちょっと寂しい帰り道
On the slightly lonely walk home

286
00:19:30,908 --> 00:19:32,108
ふらふら
Wobbling around

287
00:19:32,108 --> 00:19:35,108
特別ボーナスタイム
A special bonus time

288
00:19:35,108 --> 00:19:37,408
手を繋ごう
Let's hold hands

289
00:19:37,408 --> 00:19:42,708
大きめTシャツ 君に借りたの羽織って
Wearing the oversized T-shirt I borrowed from you

290
00:19:42,708 --> 00:19:47,908
匂わせみたいにして 困らせたいんだ
I want to tease you and make you flustered

291
00:19:47,908 --> 00:19:50,908
コンビニまた寄っちゃって
Stopping by the convenience store again

292
00:19:50,908 --> 00:19:53,408
楽しい
How fun

293
00:19:53,408 --> 00:19:56,908
もう1本だけの
Just one more bottle of

294
00:19:56,908 --> 00:19:59,408
弱いやつ
a weak one

295
