アツすぎても飽きちゃって
Even if it's too hot, I get tired of it.

298
00:20:07,688 --> 00:20:09,788
冷たいのはダメ
And cold is no good.

299
00:20:09,788 --> 00:20:11,988
やだもん
No way!

300
00:20:11,988 --> 00:20:14,888
チョコみたいな私を
Make me, who is like chocolate...

301
00:20:14,888 --> 00:20:17,788
プレシャスにして扱って
...precious, and treat me well.

302
00:20:17,788 --> 00:20:20,788
微炭酸のお酒で
With a slightly carbonated drink...

303
00:20:20,788 --> 00:20:23,988
しゅわしゅわしゅわ
...fizz, fizz, fizz.

304
00:20:23,988 --> 00:20:27,488
愛は伝えなきゃ届かない
Love won't reach unless you express it.

305
00:20:27,488 --> 00:20:29,988
恋してる証拠に
As proof that I'm in love,

306
00:20:29,988 --> 00:20:32,988
ここでちゅーってして
give me a kiss right here!

